# {{lb|sco|archaic|of two or more}} [[each|each]]; [[every]]
#* {{quote-book|1=sco|year=1786|author=w:Robert Burns|title=A Winter Night|chapter=|url=|page=|text='''Ilk''' happing bird, - wee, helpless thing!}}

